title Quality Metrics Flow

participant "Client" as Client
participant "Quality Analyzer" as Analyzer
participant "Semantic Cache" as Cache
participant "Cohesion Calculator" as Cohesion
participant "Coupling Calculator" as Coupling
participant "Complexity Analyzer" as Complexity
participant "Code Smell Detector" as Smell
participant "Report Generator" as Report

note over Client, Report: === Quality Analysis Request ===

Client->Analyzer: Analyze quality metrics for module
activate Analyzer

Analyzer->Analyzer: Parse parameters (module, depth)
Analyzer->Analyzer: Identify target cluster
Analyzer->Analyzer: Load cluster configuration

note over Client, Report: === Data Collection ===

Analyzer->Cache: Query semantic cache
activate Cache
Cache->Cache: Load structure artifacts
Cache->Cache: Load logic artifacts
Cache->Cache: Load flow artifacts
Cache->Cache: Load code artifacts
Cache->Cache: Load cross-module dependencies
Cache-->Analyzer: Artifacts loaded
deactivate Cache

note over Client, Report: === Cohesion Calculation ===

Analyzer->Cohesion: Calculate module cohesion
activate Cohesion
Cohesion->Cohesion: Extract components from structure
Cohesion->Cohesion: Analyze internal dependencies
Cohesion->Cohesion: Calculate relatedness
Cohesion->Cohesion: Compute cohesion score (0.0 - 1.0)
note right of Cohesion: High cohesion:\n- Components work together\n- Single responsibility\n- Low coupling to other modules
Cohesion-->Analyzer: Cohesion score
deactivate Cohesion

note over Client, Report: === Coupling Calculation ===

Analyzer->Coupling: Calculate module coupling
activate Coupling
Coupling->Coupling: Extract import graph
Coupling->Coupling: Identify external dependencies
Coupling->Coupling: Count incoming dependencies (afferent)
Coupling->Coupling: Count outgoing dependencies (efferent)
Coupling->Coupling: Calculate instability metric
note right of Coupling: Low coupling:\n- Minimal external dependencies\n- High stability\n- Easier to maintain
Coupling-->Analyzer: Coupling metrics
deactivate Coupling

note over Client, Report: === Complexity Analysis ===

Analyzer->Complexity: Analyze code complexity
activate Complexity
Complexity->Complexity: Calculate cyclomatic complexity
Complexity->Complexity: Calculate cognitive complexity
Complexity->Complexity: Calculate maintainability index
Complexity->Complexity: Identify complex methods
Complexity->Complexity: Identify complex classes
note right of Complexity: Complexity metrics:\n- Cyclomatic: branching complexity\n- Cognitive: mental effort\n- Maintainability: ease of change
Complexity-->Analyzer: Complexity metrics
deactivate Complexity

note over Client, Report: === Code Smell Detection ===

Analyzer->Smell: Detect code smells
activate Smell
Smell->Smell: Identify god classes
Smell->Smell: Identify feature envy
Smell->Smell: Identify long methods
Smell->Smell: Identify duplicate code
Smell->Smell: Identify dead code
Smell->Smell: Identify inappropriate intimacy
note right of Smell: Code smells:\n- Violate design principles\n- Reduce maintainability\n- Increase technical debt
Smell-->Analyzer: Code smell list
deactivate Smell

note over Client, Report: === Cross-Module Analysis ===

Analyzer->Analyzer: Analyze cross-module dependencies
Analyzer->Analyzer: Identify dependency cycles
Analyzer->Analyzer: Detect circular dependencies
Analyzer->Analyzer: Identify architectural violations
Analyzer->Analyzer: Assess layer adherence

note over Client, Report: === Report Generation ===

Analyzer->Report: Generate quality report
activate Report
Report->Report: Compile cohesion metrics
Report->Report: Compile coupling metrics
Report->Report: Compile complexity metrics
Report->Report: Compile code smells
Report->Report: Calculate overall quality score
Report->Report: Identify improvement areas
Report->Report: Generate recommendations
Report-->Analyzer: Quality report
deactivate Report

Analyzer-->Client: Quality metrics response
deactivate Analyzer

note over Client, Report: === Output Example ===

note right of Client: Quality Report:\n- Cohesion: 0.78 (Good)\n- Coupling: Low (Good)\n- Complexity: Medium (Acceptable)\n- Code Smells: 3 detected\n- Overall Score: 7.5/10\n- Recommendations:\n  - Refactor UserService (god class)\n  - Extract method (long method)\n  - Reduce dependencies (feature envy)
